{%- liquid
  assign mode = block.settings.source
  assign limit = block.settings.limit

  comment
    One block, three merchandising sources — any template, no source product.

    - popular         best sellers, rendered here in Liquid. Narrowed by the
                      Collection picker when one is set, the whole catalogue
                      when it is not.
    - collection      the picked collection, rendered here in Liquid. Same
                      machinery as popular; falls back to the store's first
                      collection rather than to everything.
    - recently_viewed the shopper's own history, which only their browser knows,
                      so reco.js fills the track from localStorage.

    None of the three answers "what goes with this product", so none emits a
    `served` beacon and none costs quota — they report impressions, clicks and
    add-to-carts only (CLAUDE.md 7.1). Custom and Related, which do, live in
    `recommendations.liquid`; that block is PDP-only and this one is not, which
    is the reason they are separate blocks.

    The Collection picker is a real "type": "collection" input — it browses the
    store's collections and nothing else. Shopify rejects visible_if on resource
    inputs by design (it conflicts with closest.<<resource>>), so it cannot hide
    for Recently viewed. Two of three sources use it, which is what makes that
    affordable here and was not on a five-source block (CLAUDE.md 7.3).
  endcomment

  if mode == 'popular' or mode == 'collection'
    assign collection_source = block.settings.collection

    comment
      Neither source renders empty just because the picker was never touched.
      Popular means the whole catalogue; Collection products stands in the
      store's first collection, which the merchant then swaps for the one they
      actually want — answering that one with every product in the shop would
      read as a bug rather than a default.

      A render-time default, not a pre-filled field: Liquid cannot write a block
      setting, so the picker itself stays empty until the merchant uses it.
    endcomment
    if collection_source == blank
      if mode == 'popular'
        assign collection_source = collections.all
      else
        comment
          `collections` exposes no first/index accessor, so the first one has to
          be iterated to. Shopify documents neither the order nor whether the
          catch-all `all` collection is in the list — it is skipped because
          landing on it would make this source identical to Popular.
        endcomment
        for shop_collection in collections
          if shop_collection.handle != 'all'
            assign collection_source = shop_collection
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif
    endif

    if collection_source != blank
      case block.settings.sort_by
        when 'newest'
          assign candidates = collection_source.products | sort: 'created_at' | reverse
        when 'price_asc'
          assign candidates = collection_source.products | sort: 'price'
        when 'price_desc'
          assign candidates = collection_source.products | sort: 'price' | reverse
        when 'title'
          assign candidates = collection_source.products | sort: 'title'
        else
          assign candidates = collection_source.products
      endcase
    endif
  endif

  assign collection_blank = false
  if mode == 'collection' and collection_source == blank
    assign collection_blank = true
  endif
-%}

{%- capture cards -%}
  {%- if mode == 'popular' or mode == 'collection' -%}
    {%- render 'reco-collection-cards', block: block, candidates: candidates, limit: limit -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- render 'reco-panel', block: block, mode: mode, cards: cards, collection_blank: collection_blank -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product Showcase",
  "target": "section",
  "javascript": "reco.js",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "source",
      "label": "Select Source",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "popular",
          "label": "Popular products"
        },
        {
          "value": "collection",
          "label": "Collection products"
        },
        {
          "value": "recently_viewed",
          "label": "Recently viewed products"
        }
      ],
      "default": "popular"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Select Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "sort_by",
      "label": "Sort by",
      "info": "Best selling follows the collection's own sort order — set it to Best selling under Products > Collections. Other options sort the first 50 products of the collection.",
      "default": "best_selling",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "best_selling",
          "label": "Best selling (collection order)"
        },
        {
          "value": "newest",
          "label": "Newest first"
        },
        {
          "value": "price_asc",
          "label": "Price: low to high"
        },
        {
          "value": "price_desc",
          "label": "Price: high to low"
        },
        {
          "value": "title",
          "label": "Alphabetical"
        }
      ],
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.source == 'popular' or block.settings.source == 'collection' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Layout",
      "default": "grid",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "grid",
          "label": "Grid"
        },
        {
          "value": "slider",
          "label": "Slider"
        },
        {
          "value": "list",
          "label": "List"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "limit",
      "label": "Products to show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "exclude_current",
      "label": "Hide the product being viewed",
      "info": "Only applies when the block is placed on a product page.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hide_sold_out",
      "label": "Hide sold out products",
      "default": false,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.source == 'popular' or block.settings.source == 'collection' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_desktop",
      "label": "Columns on desktop",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 6,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_mobile",
      "label": "Columns on mobile",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 3,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "image_ratio",
      "label": "Image shape",
      "default": "square",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "square",
          "label": "Square"
        },
        {
          "value": "portrait",
          "label": "Portrait"
        },
        {
          "value": "natural",
          "label": "Natural"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hover_image",
      "label": "Show second image on hover",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_border",
      "label": "Show card border",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_align",
      "label": "Text alignment",
      "default": "left",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "label": "Left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Centre"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "heading_size",
      "label": "Heading size",
      "default": "md",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "sm",
          "label": "Small"
        },
        {
          "value": "md",
          "label": "Medium"
        },
        {
          "value": "lg",
          "label": "Large"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Product details"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_title",
      "label": "Show product title",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_price",
      "label": "Show price",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_compare_price",
      "label": "Show original price when on sale",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_vendor",
      "label": "Show vendor",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_rating",
      "label": "Show rating",
      "info": "Shows the product rating if a reviews app has set one.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Add to cart"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_add_to_cart",
      "label": "Show add to cart button",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "add_to_cart_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "Add to cart"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "atc_behavior",
      "label": "After adding to cart",
      "default": "ajax",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "ajax",
          "label": "Stay on the page"
        },
        {
          "value": "open_drawer",
          "label": "Open the cart drawer"
        },
        {
          "value": "redirect_cart",
          "label": "Go to the cart"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "button_style",
      "label": "Button style",
      "default": "solid",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "solid",
          "label": "Solid"
        },
        {
          "value": "outline",
          "label": "Outline"
        },
        {
          "value": "text",
          "label": "Text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Slider"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "autoplay",
      "label": "Auto-advance slider",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "autoplay_speed",
      "label": "Seconds between slides",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background colour",
      "info": "Leave transparent to inherit the section's own background.",
      "default": "rgba(0,0,0,0)"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Accent colour",
      "default": "#1a1a1a"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 32,
      "unit": "px"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 32,
      "unit": "px"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
